{"version":"2.0","class":"dataset","label":"06856: Sea catches of salmon and sea trout, by region and year","source":"Statistics Norway","updated":"2022-02-10T07:00:00Z","note":["Municipalities which are wholly or partially defined as in the STN area, and where there are three or more fishers reporting catches. The STN area is the area of activity of the Sami Parliament subsidy schemes for business development (STN). Based on the 2009 definition of the STN area.","STN area: The area of activity of the Sami Parliament subsidy schemes for business development (STN). For the years 2007  and earlier: Based on the 2009 definition of the STN area. For 2008-2010 the definition of the area based on the 2011 definition of the STN area. For 2011 and 2012 the definiotion of the area based on the 2012 definition of the STN area.","As of 2019, also includes catches of sea trout, rainbow trout and humpback salmon.",".. = Data not available. Figures have not been entered into our databases or are too unreliable to be published."],"role":{"time":["Tid"],"metric":["ContentsCode"]},"id":["RegionSamisk","ContentsCode","Tid"],"size":[3,4,3],"dimension":{"RegionSamisk":{"label":"region","category":{"index":{"1849":0,"1850":1,"1853":2},"label":{"1849":"Hamarøy","1850":"Tysfjord (-2019)","1853":"Evenes"}},"extension":{"elimination":false,"show":"value"}},"ContentsCode":{"label":"contents","category":{"index":{"Fiske":0,"Fisk2":1,"Fisk3":2,"Fisk4":3},"label":{"Fiske":"Salmon less than 3 kg","Fisk2":"Salmon 3-7 kg","Fisk3":"Salmon more than 7 kg","Fisk4":"Sea trout"},"unit":{"Fiske":{"base":"kg","decimals":0},"Fisk2":{"base":"kg","decimals":0},"Fisk3":{"base":"kg","decimals":0},"Fisk4":{"base":"kg","decimals":0}}},"extension":{"elimination":false,"refperiod":{"Fiske":"01.02.","Fisk2":"01.02.","Fisk3":"01.02.","Fisk4":"01.02."},"show":"value","measuringType":{"Fiske":"Stock","Fisk2":"Stock","Fisk3":"Stock","Fisk4":"Stock"},"priceType":{"Fiske":"NotApplicable","Fisk2":"NotApplicable","Fisk3":